Use a persistent cache subdirectory for metadata on this partition layout.
Run in system init after device fs mounting and before post-fs Aconfig setup.
Mirror the platform metadata labels at the cache backing path so recursive
cache relabeling cannot turn the bound metadata into cache_file. Force the
initial metadata relabel to repair stale contexts after ROM switches even
when restorecon hashes match. Preserve the platform's existing permissions.

